    {
      "kind": "cg",
      "action": "hide"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "飯後。MSN 上，團友差不多都聊過了。黎芷君十四天沒有出現。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "凌晨撥她的電話。電話接通的同時，素婷上線，送了一句過來。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "喂，請問找誰？",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "呀呀，麻煩找黎芷君。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "在嗎？",
      "expr": "02-sigh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "喂，是凌晨嗎？這麼快不認得我的聲音了？",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我在。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "02-sigh",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "02-hips",
      "position": "far"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "他打的是給素婷的。電話那邊芷君還在等。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "喂，怎麼不答話了？",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "沒有哦。聽了你的聲音，一時不知道該說心神恍惚，還是誤打給天仙。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "你還真多廢話的啊！",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "你明天有沒有空？",
      "expr": "03-worry"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "鍵盤上停著一行還沒送出的字：怎麼了？想約我去街嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "刪掉那句，改說有空",
          "jump": "ch06-safe"
        },
        {
          "text": "把「想約我去街嗎」送出去",
          "jump": "ch06-sent"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
